  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private Sector Development Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Supporting Inclusive Growth in Somalia (SIGS) programme (&#xa3;38m, 2020-2027) is a flexible and adaptive programme. It aims to address the key constraints to inclusive, climate-resilient growth, trade and investment in Somalia. SIGS is set for an early closure due to His Majesty&#x2019;s Government (HMG) reprioritisation of overseas development assistance (ODA) and the closure of USAID which has impacted on programme funding.</narrative>
  </description>
